oduce\n\nConnect a Switch-controller and start Godot 4.6\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nGodot itself is enough to reproduce","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115453/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115453/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}